    },
    {
      "width": "380px",
      "right": "275px",
      "text": "אשר תשים לפניהם לפניהם <i data-commentator=\"Sefer Mitzvot Gadol\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, The Sanhedrin and the Penalties within their Jurisdiction\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Shulchan Arukh, Choshen Mishpat\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>ולא <i data-commentator=\"Shiltei HaGiborim\" data-label=\"א\" data-order=\"1\"></i>לפני עובדי",
